---
import LegalLayout from '../../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy & Cookies"
  description="How HITDA handles email messages, technical data and cookie preferences."
  eyebrow="Privacy"
>
  <h2>Information you send</h2>

  <p>
    HITDA receives personal information only when you choose to send
    an email. That information is used to read and respond to the
    message and is retained only as long as reasonably necessary.
  </p>

  <h2>Technical information</h2>

  <p>
    The site is hosted through Cloudflare Pages. Cloudflare may
    process technical request data for delivery, security and abuse
    prevention, including IP address, device information and request
    logs.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies and local storage</h2>

  <p>
    The site uses essential browser storage to remember cookie
    preferences. Optional analytics or advertising storage is kept
    disabled unless the visitor allows it.
  </p>

  <p>
    Google analytics or advertising services may be added later.
    When present, their optional storage categories will follow the
    choice made through the cookie banner.
  </p>

  <h2>Affiliate and external links</h2>

  <p>
    Some links lead to services operated by third parties, including
    ClickBank and product sellers. Those services apply their own
    privacy and cookie policies after you leave HITDA.
  </p>

  <h2>Services not currently offered</h2>

  <p>
    HITDA does not currently operate a newsletter, comments, user
    accounts, memberships, push notifications or its own payment
    system.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>

  <p>
    Privacy questions may be sent to
    <a href="mailto:happinessinthedigitalage@gmail.com">
      happinessinthedigitalage@gmail.com
    </a>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
